Cyberpunk style: A vast digital cityscape at night where rigid crystalline tree structures made of glowing blue data streams are being overtaken and intertwined by organic, chaotic webs of neon pink and orange connection lines. The trees represent old hierarchical systems, geometric and orderly, while the sprawling network filaments weave between and around them like living vines, creating new pathways that ignore the vertical structure entirely. Holographic tag clouds float throughout the scene like fireflies, each a small glowing node pulsing with activity. The perspective is from below looking up, showing how the rigid tree trunks eventually dissolve into the messy but vibrant mesh of interconnections above. Rain falls through the scene, each droplet carrying tiny data fragments. The overall mood is transformation—the old order giving way to something more alive, more connected, more human despite being purely digital.
